What is DevOps :
------------------------------
- it is not a new tool/technology in the market.
- it is a new culture or a process to develop release and maintain software projects with high quality in very faster way.
- for any S/W development , release and maintainance.
There are 2 Groups of engineers will work in the company.

----->Development group :
----------------------------
     the people who are involving in
       1) planning 
       2) coding 
       3) build
       4) Testing
  are considered as the Development Team or Group.
Ex : 
 -BA(Business Analyst)
 -SA(System Analyst)
 -DA(Design Archietect)
 -Build Engineers
 -Test Engineers/QA) 


----->Non- Development or Operational group or Administrators group :
---------------------------------------------------------------------
       the people who are involving in :
        1) Release
        2) Deploy
        3) Operate
        4) Monitor
are considered ad Non - Development group.
Ex : 
-Release Engineers
-Configuration Engineers
-System Admin
-Database Admin
-Network Admin ,etc..


